What this notice does not say
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

An Apache-2.0 grant covers the code. It does not grant any right to the
SWP-1 name, to the SWP-1 protocol mark, or to a root secret you do not hold —
and a watermark you cannot key is not a watermark, so a build without the
secret carries the license and none of the function.
